{"steam_appid":2672470,"steam_name":"UnLoop","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2672470/1760588752/e7705aa5469a50c3e69e990109d759b85ac3f801/1782476933/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782477179","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257366228/b14c185e821f86effe9dd4de56f4660b59d475ad/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782477179","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/5254a2a2174ee96ac01de47346cba77c36f83ab9/ss_5254a2a2174ee96ac01de47346cba77c36f83ab9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534212","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/40ea72c6c2fa01c8997405fec1ac305c08d23697/ss_40ea72c6c2fa01c8997405fec1ac305c08d23697.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534212","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/389153cd509db11121f8134424eda7ef8d2d86ab/ss_389153cd509db11121f8134424eda7ef8d2d86ab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534212","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/a2226e8674816dacfbcc7772a3abcd287c427628/ss_a2226e8674816dacfbcc7772a3abcd287c427628.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534212","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/dd3624f78d05a0e1e890e20236c671b136d86a3a/ss_dd3624f78d05a0e1e890e20236c671b136d86a3a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534212"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/06c1e246943400e9db28cb12c375d05d.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/06c1e246943400e9db28cb12c375d05d.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>UnLoop</strong> – the most chaotic VR game out there. You need a highly coordinated squad to survive this space station. The catch? <strong>YOU ARE</strong> <strong>THAT SQUAD.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the loop resets, your replica is left behind to repeat your exact physical movements, gestures, and voice in real-time. Yell instructions at your future-self, flip off your uncooperative past-self, and desperately try not to step on your own toes.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/7d1440d1ae4f695fc01d9b33c7050d2e.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/7d1440d1ae4f695fc01d9b33c7050d2e.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to argue with a room full of people who all sound exactly like you? You’ve come to the right place. After a few loops, you will be surrounded by your own past-copies, all screaming the same expletives at each other. They all disagree with you. And worst of all... they are technically correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s chaotic, it’s loud, and yes – the voices in your head are entirely real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/291498392c87a1433caeafa02ce7b073.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/291498392c87a1433caeafa02ce7b073.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruined the timeline? Didn’t catch a crucial item? No problem. Just raise your laser gun, shoot yourself, and instantly reset the loop. Or shoot your copy who made a bad throw, you are the original one anyway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death isn't a failure here. It's just a tactical undo button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/e211233eab7a82fffbd4d8f8d022a141.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/e211233eab7a82fffbd4d8f8d022a141.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is solved by coordinating with your past actions. Which sounds brilliant, until you realize your past-self had no idea what they were doing either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the sheer, unadulterated ego trip of figuring things out all by yourself. When you finally spend 15 minutes coordinating three of your past-copies just to pass a single keycard through a door, you’ll feel like an absolute mastermind solving the mysteries of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ll let you have that. You’re welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR/SteamVR; Supported controllers &amp; headsets: Meta Quest, Pico, Valve Index, HTC Vive Wands<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Windows Mixed Reality (WMR) headsets support is untested, not all controllers might work.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR/SteamVR; Supported controllers &amp; headsets: Meta Quest, Pico, Valve Index, HTC Vive Wands<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Windows Mixed Reality (WMR) headsets support is untested, not all controllers might work.</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Early Access"],"developers":["Superposition NULL"],"publishers":["CM Games"],"release_date":"Nov 13, 2025"}